@startuml seq_search
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber
hide footbox
actor "User" as U
participant "React Client\n(Search Bar)" as C
participant "SearchController" as SC
participant "SearchService" as SS
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

U -> C : Type query, optional filters\n(lecturer only, date range)
C -> C : Debounce 300 ms; ignore empty query
C -> SC : GET /api/search?q=...&lecturer=1&from=...&to=...
SC -> SS : search(viewer, q, filters)
SS -> SS : start timer; classify query\n(#hashtag / module code / keyword)
alt hashtag
  SS -> DB : SELECT ... JOIN "POST_HASHTAG_T" JOIN "HASHTAG_T"\nWHERE hsh_name = $1
else module code
  SS -> DB : SELECT ... JOIN "MODULE_T" WHERE mod_code ILIKE $1
else keyword
  SS -> DB : SELECT ..., ts_rank(pst_search_doc, q) AS rank\nWHERE pst_search_doc @@ websearch_to_tsquery($1)\nOR mod_name / programme ILIKE $1
end
note right of DB : All branches also apply visibility\nand optional lecturer/date filters,\nORDER BY rank DESC LIMIT 20
DB --> SS : matching notes
SS -> DB : SELECT users WHERE usr_display_name ILIKE $1 LIMIT 10
DB --> SS : matching users
SS -> SS : stop timer; log elapsed ms (NFR1 < 3000)
SS --> SC : {notes, people, elapsedMs}
SC --> C : 200
C --> U : Show Notes and People tabs\nor "No results" with active filters
@enduml
